WEBVTT

00:09.448 --> 00:10.482
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.586 --> 00:12.275
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.379 --> 00:13.724
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.827 --> 00:15.517
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.620 --> 00:18.586
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.689 --> 00:20.793
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.896 --> 00:22.827
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.931 --> 00:24.862
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.965 --> 00:26.551
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.655 --> 00:28.862
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.965 --> 00:30.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.482 --> 00:32.827
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.931 --> 00:34.758
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.862 --> 00:36.793
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.896 --> 00:38.724
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.827 --> 00:40.689
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.793 --> 00:41.931
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.034 --> 00:44.241
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.344 --> 00:46.689
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.793 --> 00:49.000
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:49.103 --> 00:50.448
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.172 --> 00:56.068
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:56.172 --> 01:02.137
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:02.241 --> 01:03.655
- BIKINI BOTTOM ACTION NEWS!
- 比基尼泳裤动作新闻！

01:03.758 --> 01:05.000
TONIGHT'S TOP STORY:
今晚的头条新闻：

01:05.103 --> 01:07.620
A WEALTHY ENTREPRENEUR
WHO WISHES TO REMAIN ANONYMOUS
富有的企业家
谁希望保持匿名

01:07.724 --> 01:10.000
IS SPONSORING
THIS YEAR'S SLEIGH RACE.
正在赞助
今年的雪橇比赛。

01:10.103 --> 01:13.344
FIRST PRIZE: $1 MILLION.
一等奖：100万美元。

01:13.448 --> 01:15.000
ALL OF BIKINI BOTTOM
HAS ENTERED,
全部比基尼下装
已进入，

01:15.103 --> 01:16.931
BUT ONLY ONE HOPEFUL WILL WIN.
但只有一个有希望的人会获胜。

01:17.034 --> 01:19.379
WE JOIN ROVING REPORTER
PERCH PERKINS
我们加入流动记者
鲈鱼帕金斯

01:19.482 --> 01:20.931
LIVE AT THE SCENE.
现场直播。

01:21.034 --> 01:23.758
- THE TENSION'S BUILDING UP
AS THE CONTESTANTS LINE UP
- 紧张局势加剧
当参赛者排队时

01:23.862 --> 01:25.413
TO WIN THE PRIZE.
赢得奖品。

01:25.517 --> 01:27.275
- GARY AND I ARE GONNA TRY
TO WIN THE PRIZE
- 加里和我要尝试
赢得奖品

01:27.379 --> 01:29.379
SO MR. KRABS CAN FIX UP
THE KRUSTY KRAB.
所以先生。蟹可以修复
脆皮蟹。

01:29.482 --> 01:30.551
RIGHT, GARY?
对吧，加里？

01:30.655 --> 01:31.655
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

01:31.758 --> 01:32.793
- I HEAR YA.
- 我听到了。

01:32.896 --> 01:34.103
I HOPE I WIN
SO I CAN BUY
我希望我赢了
所以我可以买

01:34.206 --> 01:36.034
ALL THE KRABBY PATTIES
I WANT.
所有的蟹肉饼
我想要。

01:36.137 --> 01:38.896
GOOD THING I BROUGHT OUT
THE HEAVY ARTILLERY.
我带来的好东西
重型火炮。

01:39.000 --> 01:40.206
GOOEY WORMS.
粘糊糊的蠕虫。

01:40.310 --> 01:42.068
- UH, PATRICK,
THOSE DON'T MOVE.
- 呃，帕特里克，
那些不动。

01:42.172 --> 01:43.724
- SURE THEY DO.
GIDDY-UP!
- 当然可以。
头晕目眩！

01:43.827 --> 01:44.793
YA!
是啊！

01:44.896 --> 01:46.068
SEE?
看？

01:46.172 --> 01:47.206
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

01:47.310 --> 01:49.586
YOU DON'T STAND A CHANCE,
KRABS.
你没有机会，
螃蟹。

01:49.689 --> 01:51.206
KAREN AND I--
凯伦和我——

01:51.310 --> 01:55.275
I MEAN, MY WORM AND I
ARE GONNA WHIP YOUR TAILFIN!
我的意思是，我和我的蠕虫
我要鞭打你的尾鳍了！

01:55.379 --> 01:56.551
RIGHT, WORM?
对吧，蠕虫？

01:56.655 --> 01:57.689
- RUFF, RUFF.
- 拉夫，拉夫。

01:57.793 --> 01:59.172
- AND WITH THE PRIZE MONEY,
- 有了奖金，

01:59.275 --> 02:02.551
I'LL TOPPLE YOUR RESTAURANT
EMPIRE ONCE AND FOR ALL!
我会推倒你的餐厅
帝国一劳永逸！

02:02.655 --> 02:04.931
- HA! WHERE FETCHIN'
MONEY'S INVOLVED,
- 哈！去哪里取
涉及金钱，

02:05.034 --> 02:06.448
NOBODY TOPPLES ME.
没有人能推翻我。

02:06.551 --> 02:09.103
- CONTESTANTS,
READY YOUR SLEDS.
- 参赛者，
准备好你的雪橇。

02:09.206 --> 02:10.482
- EXCUSE ME, SIR.
- 对不起，先生。

02:10.586 --> 02:12.482
HOW DO YOU THINK YOU'LL DO
IN THE RACE?
你觉得你会怎么做
在比赛中？

02:12.586 --> 02:14.448
- HELLO OUT THERE,
BIKINI BOTTOM.
- 你好，
比基尼下装。

02:14.551 --> 02:16.482
I'M GLAD I CAN FINALLY TALK
我很高兴我终于可以说话了

02:16.586 --> 02:19.413
TO MY ADORING FANS
ON TELEVISION.
致我崇拜的粉丝
在电视上。

02:19.517 --> 02:21.275
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

02:21.379 --> 02:22.758
- BEST OF LUCK TO YOU.
- 祝你好运。

02:22.862 --> 02:24.793
OH, EXCUSE ME, MISS.
哦，对不起，小姐。

02:24.896 --> 02:25.793
- ON YOUR MARK...
- 就你的目标...

02:25.896 --> 02:28.137
- SO LONG, SUCKERS.
- 再见，傻瓜们。

02:28.241 --> 02:29.448
- GET SET...
- 准备好...

02:29.551 --> 02:32.724
GO!
去！

02:32.827 --> 02:37.068
- COME ON, WORMIES!
GIDDY-UP!
- 来吧，蠕虫们！
头晕目眩！

02:37.172 --> 02:38.862
HMM.
唔。

02:44.275 --> 02:47.827
- ALONE AT LAST!
- 最后一个人了！

02:47.931 --> 02:51.103
NOW THERE'S NOTHING BETWEEN ME
AND THE SECRET FORMULA.
现在我之间什么都没有了
以及秘密公式。

02:51.206 --> 02:52.586
[laughs]
[笑]

02:52.689 --> 02:55.206
[cheering]
[欢呼]

02:55.310 --> 02:56.517
- COME ON, BOYS!
- 来吧，孩子们！

02:56.620 --> 02:58.206
GET ME TO THE GREENBACKS!
带我去美元！

02:58.310 --> 03:00.413
- I THINK NOT, OLD MAN.
- 我想不会，老兄。

03:00.517 --> 03:02.275
TURBO BOOST, KAREN.
涡轮增压，凯伦。

03:02.379 --> 03:04.172
[laughs]
[笑]

03:07.896 --> 03:09.344
- NO!
- 不！

03:09.448 --> 03:11.448
I CAN'T LET HIM WIN!
我不能让他赢！

03:11.551 --> 03:13.448
- DON'T WORRY.
HE WON'T.
- 不用担心。
他不会。

03:13.551 --> 03:16.206
I WILL.
我会。

03:16.310 --> 03:18.379
YEE-HAW!
呀呀！

03:18.482 --> 03:20.034
- HI, SPONGEBOB.
- 嗨，海绵宝宝。

03:20.137 --> 03:21.517
- HI, PATRICK.
- 嗨，帕特里克。

03:21.620 --> 03:22.655
WHERE'S YOUR SLEIGH?
你的雪橇在哪里？

03:22.758 --> 03:26.517
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

03:26.620 --> 03:29.620
- HOP IN.
WE'LL GIVE YOU A LIFT.
- 跳进去。
我们会载您一程。

03:29.724 --> 03:30.931
[brakes squealing]
[刹车尖叫声]

03:31.034 --> 03:34.689
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

03:34.793 --> 03:37.137
- COME ON, GARY!
- 来吧，加里！

03:37.241 --> 03:40.206
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

03:43.965 --> 03:45.172
LOCKED?
锁定？

03:45.275 --> 03:46.586
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:46.689 --> 03:48.896
GOOD THING I BROUGHT
THIS ALONG.
我带来的好东西
就这样。

03:49.000 --> 03:51.310
[blade whirring]
[刀锋呼呼作响]

03:51.413 --> 03:53.793
[screaming]
[尖叫]

03:53.896 --> 03:55.310
OW.
哦。

03:55.413 --> 04:00.275
I'M GONNA NEED SOMETHING
WITH MORE FIREPOWER.
我需要一些东西
拥有更多火力。

04:00.379 --> 04:01.965
- WHOO-WEE!
- 哇哦！

04:02.068 --> 04:04.103
LOOKS LIKE I LOST 'EM.
看起来我失去了他们。

04:04.206 --> 04:05.344
[electricity crackles]
[电流爆裂声]

04:05.448 --> 04:06.793
THE REMOTE SHORTED OUT.
遥控器短路。

04:06.896 --> 04:08.620
THE ROBOTS ARE STUCK
IN HIGH GEAR.
机器人被卡住了
全速前进。

04:08.724 --> 04:13.275
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:13.379 --> 04:15.655
- THOSE DIMWITS DON'T STAND
A CHANCE
- 那些笨蛋受不了
一个机会

04:15.758 --> 04:17.724
AGAINST MY IMPORTED WORM.
针对我的进口蠕虫。

04:17.827 --> 04:20.241
[brakes squeal]
[刹车尖叫声]

04:20.344 --> 04:22.206
- AHH.
-啊啊。

04:22.310 --> 04:24.000
- HEY, WHAT'S THE BIG IDEA?
- 嘿，有什么好主意吗？

04:24.103 --> 04:25.275
- OH, I BEG YOUR PUDDING.
- 哦，我求你的布丁。

04:25.379 --> 04:26.931
IT'S TEA TIME, ISN'T IT?
现在是下午茶时间，不是吗？

04:27.034 --> 04:30.724
- I DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR THIS.
- 我没有时间
为此。

04:30.827 --> 04:32.137
TEA TIME.
下午茶时间。

04:32.241 --> 04:36.586
OF ALL THE RIDICULOUS
CONCEPTS.
所有荒谬的事
概念。

04:36.689 --> 04:38.034
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:38.137 --> 04:43.034
WHOA! WHOA!
哇啊！哇啊！

04:43.137 --> 04:44.793
AH!
啊！

04:48.448 --> 04:49.896
both: ♪ AND WE
RACE RACE RACE ♪
两者：♪ 还有我们
比赛比赛比赛♪

04:50.000 --> 04:51.275
♪ DOWN THE SNOW SNOW SNOW
♪ 下雪 雪 雪

04:51.379 --> 04:52.586
- WOW! LOOK AT THAT!
- 哇！看看那个！

04:52.689 --> 04:53.586
- SQUIDWARD!
- 章鱼哥！

04:53.689 --> 04:55.000
BUDDY!
伙伴！

04:55.103 --> 04:56.103
HE DOESN'T LOOK SO HOT.
他看起来没那么热。

04:56.206 --> 04:57.241
WE BETTER TAKE HIM WITH US.
我们最好带他一起去。

04:57.344 --> 04:58.275
- GOOD IDEA.
- 好主意。

04:58.379 --> 05:04.275
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:04.379 --> 05:05.620
both: ♪ AND WE RACE RACE RACE
两者：♪ 我们比赛比赛比赛

05:05.724 --> 05:06.931
♪ DOWN THE SNOW SNOW SNOW
♪ 下雪 雪 雪

05:07.034 --> 05:08.344
♪ AND WE RACE RACE RACE
♪ 我们比赛比赛比赛

05:08.448 --> 05:09.413
♪ DOWN THE SNOW SNOW SNOW
♪ 下雪 雪 雪

05:09.517 --> 05:11.000
♪ AND WE RA--
- [moans]
♪ 而我们——
- [呻吟]

05:11.103 --> 05:12.689
- PATRICK, DID YOU HEAR THAT?
- 帕特里克，你听到了吗？

05:12.793 --> 05:16.931
- YEAH.
- 是的。

05:17.034 --> 05:18.655
both: SANDY?
两人：桑迪？

05:18.758 --> 05:21.448
- [shivering]
TH-TH-TH-TH-THANKS, GUYS.
- [发抖]
谢谢，伙计们。

05:21.551 --> 05:22.689
- NO PROBLEM.
RIGHT, GARE?
- 没问题。
对吧，GARE？

05:22.793 --> 05:25.896
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

05:28.896 --> 05:32.344
- SNIFF OUT THE MONEY,
LITTLE GUYS.
- 嗅出钱，
小家伙们。

05:32.448 --> 05:34.655
COME ON.
MUSH.
快点。
糊状。

05:34.758 --> 05:36.586
[stomachs rumbling]
[肚子咕咕叫]

05:36.689 --> 05:38.034
[growling]
[咆哮]

05:38.137 --> 05:39.551
WAIT A MINUTE.
等一下。

05:39.655 --> 05:41.965
I WAS GONNA FEED YOU,
HONEST.
我要喂你，
诚实。

05:42.068 --> 05:44.137
[barking]
[叫声]

05:44.241 --> 05:45.413
all: ♪ AND WE RACE RACE RACE
所有人：♪ 我们比赛比赛比赛

05:45.517 --> 05:46.931
♪ DOWN THE SNOW SNOW SNOW
♪ 下雪 雪 雪

05:47.034 --> 05:48.586
- HELP!
- HI, MR. KRABS.
- 帮助！
- 嗨，先生。螃蟹。

05:48.689 --> 05:50.275
- I'VE JUST BEEN TURNED
INTO LUNCH MEAT
- 我刚刚转变
进入午餐肉

05:50.379 --> 05:51.689
BY ME OWN WORMS.
我自己的蠕虫。

05:51.793 --> 05:53.896
[snarling]
[咆哮]

05:54.000 --> 05:55.551
- AH!
HOP IN, SIR.
- 啊！
上车，先生。

05:55.655 --> 05:57.172
WE'LL GET YOU OUT OF HERE.
我们会带你离开这里。

05:57.275 --> 06:01.931
- MUCH APPRECIATED, BOY.
- 非常感谢，男孩。

06:02.034 --> 06:03.103
- FASTER!
- FASTER! FASTER!
- 快点！
- 快点！快点！

06:03.206 --> 06:04.620
- FASTER! FASTER!
- FASTER! FASTER!
- 快点！快点！
- 快点！快点！

06:04.724 --> 06:05.620
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:05.724 --> 06:06.724
[barking]
[叫声]

06:06.827 --> 06:08.172
- FASTER! FASTER!
- FASTER! FASTER!
- 快点！快点！
- 快点！快点！

06:08.275 --> 06:09.724
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:09.827 --> 06:11.482
[barking]
[叫声]

06:11.586 --> 06:13.206
all: FASTER!
所有人：更快！

06:13.310 --> 06:14.344
[barking]
[叫声]

06:14.448 --> 06:17.551
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:17.655 --> 06:20.620
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

06:20.724 --> 06:23.172
- THIS IS A DEAD END!
- 这是一个死胡同！

06:23.275 --> 06:25.103
[barking]
[叫声]

06:25.206 --> 06:27.551
[screaming]
[尖叫]

06:27.655 --> 06:29.655
- [deep roar]
- [深沉的怒吼]

06:29.758 --> 06:34.862
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

06:34.965 --> 06:36.103
[meowing]
[喵喵叫]

06:36.206 --> 06:37.862
[cheering]
- GOOD JOB, GARY!
[欢呼]
- 干得好，加里！

06:37.965 --> 06:39.172
WAY TO GO!
一路走好！

06:39.275 --> 06:44.172
[deep rumbling]
[低沉的隆隆声]

06:44.275 --> 06:46.689
- GREAT.
NOW WE'RE TRAPPED.
- 伟大的。
现在我们被困住了。

06:50.413 --> 06:52.275
GOOD THINKING, SQUIRREL.
好主意，松鼠。

06:52.379 --> 06:53.827
THIS SHOULD KEEP US ALIVE
FOR AT LEAST...
这应该让我们活下去
至少...

06:53.931 --> 06:55.655
[gulps]
A FEW HOURS.
[吞咽]
几个小时。

06:55.758 --> 06:56.758
OOH.
哦。

06:56.862 --> 06:58.379
- [shivering]
- [发抖]

06:58.482 --> 07:02.448
IT'S S-S-S-SO C-C-COLD.
这是 S-S-S-SO C-C-COLD。

07:02.551 --> 07:03.896
- [teeth chattering]
- [牙齿打颤]

07:08.827 --> 07:11.551
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

07:11.655 --> 07:13.482
- [shivering]
- [发抖]

07:13.586 --> 07:16.896
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

07:17.000 --> 07:21.827
- HEY!
HOW ABOUT A CAMPFIRE SONG?
- 嘿！
来一首篝火之歌怎么样？

07:21.931 --> 07:25.344
- [growling]
NO SINGING!
- [咆哮]
不准唱歌！

07:25.448 --> 07:28.448
all: SQUIDWARD!
全体：章鱼哥！

07:28.551 --> 07:30.310
- ALL RIGHT.
ALL RIGHT.
- 好的。
好的。

07:30.413 --> 07:33.896
SOMEBODY GET ME A BLANKET.
谁给我拿条毯子。

07:34.000 --> 07:35.103
[teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

07:35.206 --> 07:36.379
- HEY, SQUIDWARD.
- 嘿，章鱼哥。

07:36.482 --> 07:38.000
WHAT'S WITH THE EXTRA
FOOT, BUDDY?
额外有什么
脚，伙计？

07:38.103 --> 07:39.206
- HUH?
- 嗯？

07:39.310 --> 07:41.517
THIS ISN'T MINE.
这不是我的。

07:41.620 --> 07:44.448
WHOA!
哇啊！

07:44.551 --> 07:46.896
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

07:47.000 --> 07:48.896
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:49.000 --> 07:52.103
[roaring]
[咆哮]

07:54.103 --> 07:55.862
- NOT YOU AGAIN.
- 又不是你。

08:02.068 --> 08:03.896
- HA!
SLIMY SNOW VERMIN!
- 哈！
粘滑的雪害虫！

08:04.000 --> 08:05.241
YOU MISSED!
你错过了！

08:05.344 --> 08:06.758
- THAT WEREN'T THE ATTACK.
- 那不是攻击。

08:06.862 --> 08:10.344
- HUH?
- 嗯？

08:10.448 --> 08:11.655
- HIT THE DECK!
- 上台吧！

08:11.758 --> 08:12.689
- [spitting]
- [随地吐痰]

08:12.793 --> 08:16.000
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:16.103 --> 08:18.000
- [meowing]
- GARY!
- [喵喵叫]
- 加里！

08:21.620 --> 08:22.517
- [spitting]
- [随地吐痰]

08:22.620 --> 08:25.689
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:27.862 --> 08:33.275
OH, NO, NOT AGAIN.
哦，不，不再这样了。

08:33.379 --> 08:34.517
- SHE'S RELOADING.
- 她正在重新加载。

08:34.620 --> 08:39.586
NOW'S OUR CHANCE TO SCRAM.
现在是我们紧急撤离的机会。

08:39.689 --> 08:41.586
- WHAT IS THAT
FORMIDABLE CREATURE?
-那是什么
强大的生物？

08:41.689 --> 08:44.103
- THAT, ME BOY,
IS NONE OTHER
- 那，我男孩，
不是别人

08:44.206 --> 08:47.517
THAN THE ABOMINABLE
SNOW MOLLUSK.
比可憎的
雪软体动物。

08:47.620 --> 08:48.758
- I THOUGHT THAT WAS
JUST A MYTH.
- 我以为那是
只是一个神话。

08:48.862 --> 08:51.103
- OH, I ASSURE YOU SHE'S
NO MYTH.
- 哦，我向你保证她是
没有神话。

08:51.206 --> 08:53.586
SHE'S AS REAL AS SANTY CLAUS.
她就像圣诞老人一样真实。

08:53.689 --> 08:56.103
'TWAS BACK WHEN I WAS
A YOUNG SEA CAPTAIN
当我回来的时候
年轻的船长

08:56.206 --> 08:58.344
SAILING THE ARCTIC SEAS
航行于北冰洋

08:58.448 --> 09:00.586
WHEN THE BEHEMOTH
AND I FIRST TANGLED.
当巨兽
我首先陷入了纠结。

09:00.689 --> 09:05.241
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

09:05.344 --> 09:08.586
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:08.689 --> 09:09.931
- DON'T TELL ME, MR. KRABS.
- 别告诉我，先生。螃蟹。

09:10.034 --> 09:11.482
YOU PEELED BACK THOSE TENTACLES
你剥开了那些触手

09:11.586 --> 09:12.689
WITH YOUR BARE CLAWS.
用你赤手空拳的爪子。

09:12.793 --> 09:14.241
YOU SINGLE-HANDEDLY SAVED
YOUR VESSEL
你单枪匹马得救了
您的船只

09:14.344 --> 09:16.034
FROM CERTAIN DOOM.
来自某种厄运。

09:16.137 --> 09:17.344
- NO, THAT DIDN'T WORK.
- 不，那不起作用。

09:17.448 --> 09:19.137
SHE GULPED ME
AND ME CREW DOWN
她吞了我
和我一起下船

09:19.241 --> 09:21.413
IN ONE SWIFT SWALLOW.
一口吞下。

09:21.517 --> 09:22.862
- OH, MY.
- 哦，我的。

09:22.965 --> 09:24.000
WELL, AT LEAST YOU
BRAVELY ESCAPED
好吧，至少你
勇敢逃脱

09:24.103 --> 09:25.068
TO TELL THE TALE.
讲述故事。

09:25.172 --> 09:27.931
- WEREN'T BRAVERY
THAT GOT US OUT.
- 不勇敢
这让我们出去了。

09:28.034 --> 09:30.965
LET'S JUST SAY WE
HAD TO WAIT
我们就说我们
必须等待

09:31.068 --> 09:34.827
FOR NATURE TO TAKE ITS COURSE.
让自然顺其自然。

09:34.931 --> 09:37.448
- HMM?
OH!
- 唔？
哦！

09:37.551 --> 09:39.103
EWW.
EWW。
EWW。
EWW。
EWW。
EWW。
EWW。
EWW。

09:39.206 --> 09:40.620
- I HATE TO BREAK UP
STORY TIME,
- 我讨厌分手
故事时间，

09:40.724 --> 09:42.275
BUT I'D LIKE TO NOT
GET EATEN TODAY.
但我不想
今天就吃吧。

09:42.379 --> 09:46.344
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

09:50.379 --> 09:54.000
- GARY, STEP ON IT!
- 加里，踩上去！

09:56.758 --> 09:57.896
WHOA, YEAH, GARY!
哇，是啊，加里！

09:58.000 --> 09:59.379
YOU ARE REALLY MOTORING NOW.
你现在真的在开车了。

09:59.482 --> 10:03.482
RIGHT, GUYS?
对吧，伙计们？

10:03.586 --> 10:07.034
WE FORGOT SQUIDWARD!
我们忘记了章鱼哥！

10:14.310 --> 10:16.275
LEFT, GARY! LEFT!
向左，加里！左边！

10:16.379 --> 10:18.000
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

10:21.551 --> 10:24.896
THERE HE IS!
他就在那里！

10:25.000 --> 10:26.655
PATRICK, I NEED A GOOEY WORM.
帕特里克，我需要一条粘糊糊的蠕虫。

10:26.758 --> 10:29.896
- OH, BE GENTLE.
IT'S MY LAST ONE.
- 哦，要温柔。
这是我的最后一个。

10:30.000 --> 10:32.931
- HOLD TIGHT, BUDDY.
- 坚持住，伙计。

10:33.034 --> 10:36.724
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

10:36.827 --> 10:41.758
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:41.862 --> 10:42.827
[roaring]
[咆哮]

10:42.931 --> 10:44.862
- SPONGEBOB, COME ON!
- 海绵宝宝，加油！

10:44.965 --> 10:48.275
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.
我们离开这里吧。

10:48.379 --> 10:52.379
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

10:56.551 --> 11:00.034
MMM.
NUM-NUM.
嗯。
NUM-NUM。

11:00.137 --> 11:01.413
- OOH-WEE!
- 哦，哦！

11:01.517 --> 11:04.310
THAT WAS A CLOSE ONE,
WASN'T IT, MR. KRABS?
那是一场很接近的比赛，
不是吗，先生。螃蟹？

11:04.413 --> 11:06.068
HUH?
嗯？

11:06.172 --> 11:07.965
OF ALL THE HORNSWAGGLES!
所有的牛角！

11:08.068 --> 11:09.724
THE BANDIT'S TRYING
TO WEIGH US DOWN
强盗的尝试
压垮我们

11:09.827 --> 11:12.344
WHILE HE MAKES OFF
WITH THE PRIZE HISSELF!
当他离开时
亲自获奖！

11:12.448 --> 11:13.965
- [laughs]
- [笑]

11:14.068 --> 11:15.758
I'D SOONER SWALLOW
A JELLYFISH
我会尽快吞下去
水母

11:15.862 --> 11:17.413
THAN SHARE ME WINNINGS
WITH THAT--
不如分享我的奖金
有了这个——

11:17.517 --> 11:18.965
OH!
哦！

11:19.068 --> 11:20.862
[electricity crackles]
[muffled scream]
[电流爆裂声]
[低沉的尖叫声]

11:20.965 --> 11:22.413
- WE CAN'T LET
THAT DOUBLE-CROSSER BEAT US
- 我们不能让
那个双穿越者击败了我们

11:22.517 --> 11:23.793
TO THE LOOT.
到战利品。

11:23.896 --> 11:28.206
FULL STEAM AHEAD AND DON'T
STOP FOR NOTHING, GARY!
全力以赴，但不要
别停下来，加里！

11:28.310 --> 11:29.965
- HEY!
- 嘿！

11:30.068 --> 11:33.034
[brakes squealing]
[刹车尖叫声]

11:37.103 --> 11:39.413
- WHAT'S THE BIG EMERGENCY,
PATRICK?
- 有什么大紧急情况，
帕特里克？

11:39.517 --> 11:41.241
- I SAW SOMETHING SHINY.
- 我看到一些闪亮的东西。

11:41.344 --> 11:45.172
- OH, WELL, LET'S JUST DROP
EVERYTHING THEN.
- 哦，好吧，我们就放弃吧
然后一切。

11:45.275 --> 11:47.172
- WELL, WAIT, SANDY,
I SEE IT TOO.
- 好吧，等等，桑迪，
我也看到了。

11:47.275 --> 11:50.448
IT LOOKS LIKE KAREN.
它看起来像凯伦。

11:52.827 --> 11:54.620
- KAREN?
- 凯伦？

11:54.724 --> 11:57.344
- I'D SAY SHE'S IN SWIFT NEED
OF A REBOOT.
- 我想说她很快就需要
重新启动。

11:57.448 --> 12:00.172
HEE-YA!
嘿呀！

12:00.275 --> 12:03.413
- YOU CAN'T STAND A CHANCE,
KRABS.
- 你没有机会，
螃蟹。

12:03.517 --> 12:05.275
- HUH?
- 嗯？

12:05.379 --> 12:06.448
PLANKTON?
浮游生物？

12:06.551 --> 12:08.172
- DON'T TAIL KRABS.
- 不要尾部蟹。

12:08.275 --> 12:09.241
- POOR GUY.
- 可怜的家伙。

12:09.344 --> 12:10.310
THE ICE IS REALLY
GETTIN' TO HIM.
冰真的是
去找他。

12:10.413 --> 12:11.551
- THEN WE GOT TO BUST
HIM OUT QUICK!
- 然后我们就破产了
快让他出去！

12:11.655 --> 12:14.482
I'M GONNA SIT ON HIM.
我要坐在他身上。

12:14.586 --> 12:15.862
- PATRICK, NO!
HE'S VERY...
- 帕特里克，不！
他非常...

12:15.965 --> 12:19.137
[crash]
FRAGILE.
[崩溃]
脆弱。

12:19.241 --> 12:21.965
- KRABS...STAND.
- 蟹...站起来。

12:22.068 --> 12:23.310
- A SIMULACRA!
- 拟像！

12:23.413 --> 12:26.034
- SANDY, PLEASE!
LANGUAGE.
- 桑迪，拜托！
语言。

12:26.137 --> 12:27.689
- NAW, SILLY.
- 不，愚蠢的。

12:27.793 --> 12:30.379
I'M SAYING PLANKTON SENT
A ROBOTIC DUMMY IN HIS STEAD.
我是说浮游生物已发送
一个机器人假人代替了他。

12:30.482 --> 12:31.551
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

12:31.655 --> 12:33.034
MY SELFISH HUSBAND REMAINS
我自私的丈夫依然存在

12:33.137 --> 12:34.620
IN WARM,
SUNNY BIKINI BOTTOM
在温暖的情况下，
阳光比基尼泳裤

12:34.724 --> 12:37.896
WHILE I FREEZE MY SOLDER OFF
IN THIS BITTER TUNDRA.
当我冻结我的焊料时
在这片苦涩的苔原上。

12:38.000 --> 12:42.068
IN FACT, THIS WHOLE RACE WAS
A PLOT DEVISED BY PLANKTON.
事实上，这整场比赛都是
由浮游生物设计的情节。

12:42.172 --> 12:43.655
WITH THE ENTIRE TOWN
DISTRACTED,
与整个城镇
心烦意乱，

12:43.758 --> 12:47.000
HE'S FREE TO PURSUE THE KRABBY
PATTY FORMULA UNDETECTED.
他可以自由地追捕蟹蟹
未检测到肉饼配方。

12:47.103 --> 12:48.586
- PURSUE?
FORMULA?
- 追求？
公式？

12:48.689 --> 12:50.448
WE GOT TO FIND MR. KRABS
RIGHT NOW.
我们必须找到先生。蟹蟹
现在。

12:50.551 --> 12:52.482
- AND EXACTLY HOW
DO YOU PROPOSE WE FIND HIM?
- 以及具体如何
你建议我们找到他吗？

12:52.586 --> 12:55.827
- I SAW MR. KRABS PASS BY JUST
BEFORE MY SYSTEM FAILED,
- 我看到先生。螃蟹刚刚经过
在我的系统出现故障之前，

12:55.931 --> 12:57.034
HEADING SOUTHWEST.
向西南方向行驶。

12:57.137 --> 13:00.793
- WELL, WHAT ARE WE
WAITING FOR?
- 那么，我们是什么？
还在等什么？

13:00.896 --> 13:02.551
YOU HEARD THE LADY,
GARY.
你听到那位女士的话，
加里。

13:02.655 --> 13:03.551
SOUTHWEST!
西南！

13:03.655 --> 13:05.724
MUSH! MUSH!
糊涂！糊涂！

13:08.551 --> 13:12.482
- [laughs]
- [笑]

13:12.586 --> 13:15.344
OUCH!
哎哟！

13:15.448 --> 13:18.931
SO THIS SAFE IS IMPERVIOUS
TO FLAME, EH?
所以这个保险箱是密封的
着火了，嗯？

13:19.034 --> 13:20.551
IT SEEMS AS THOUGH
I'LL HAVE TO GET
看起来好像
我必须得到

13:20.655 --> 13:23.068
A LITTLE MORE DESTRUCTIVE!
更具破坏性一点！

13:23.172 --> 13:24.206
[toy squeaks]
[玩具吱吱声]

13:24.310 --> 13:25.448
AHEM.
咳咳。

13:25.551 --> 13:29.655
I MEANT DESTRUCTIVE!
我的意思是破坏性的！

13:29.758 --> 13:33.172
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

13:33.275 --> 13:36.068
- THAT-A-BOY, GARY.
- 那个男孩，加里。

13:40.413 --> 13:42.241
- [screeches]
- [尖叫声]

13:42.344 --> 13:45.275
[screaming]
[尖叫]

13:51.931 --> 13:53.896
- [sighs]
- [sighs]
- [叹气]
- [叹气]

13:54.000 --> 13:55.344
- CLIFF!
- 悬崖！

13:55.448 --> 13:57.344
[screaming]
[尖叫]

13:57.448 --> 14:00.586
HOLD ON, SPONGEBOB!
坚持住，海绵宝宝！

14:00.689 --> 14:01.862
- [gags]
- [笑声]

14:07.482 --> 14:09.896
WE MADE IT.
HOORAY.
我们做到了。
万岁。

14:10.000 --> 14:12.551
RIGHT, SQUIDWARD?
对吧，章鱼哥？

14:12.655 --> 14:13.620
- [gasps]
OH, MY GOSH!
- [喘气]
哦，天哪！

14:13.724 --> 14:17.379
PATRICK,
LEAN TO THE OTHER SIDE.
帕特里克，
向另一侧倾斜。

14:19.275 --> 14:20.241
EXCUSE ME, MA'AM.
对不起，女士。

14:20.344 --> 14:25.827
- WHAT?
- 什么？

14:25.931 --> 14:26.931
- GOTCHA.
- 明白了。

14:27.034 --> 14:28.551
- HEY, SANDY,
HAVE YOU GIVEN
- 嘿，桑迪，
你有没有给予

14:28.655 --> 14:29.689
ANY THOUGHT
TO HOW WE'RE GONNA--
任何想法
我们将如何——

14:29.793 --> 14:31.517
OW!
噢！

14:31.620 --> 14:35.413
LAND?
土地？

14:35.517 --> 14:39.413
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

14:39.517 --> 14:42.068
- FIRE IN THE HOLE!
- 洞里着火了！

14:42.172 --> 14:45.137
[explosion]
[爆炸]

14:51.103 --> 14:53.068
RATS.
老鼠。

14:53.172 --> 14:54.965
[all shivering]
[浑身发抖]

14:55.068 --> 14:57.310
- ALL RIGHT, FELLAS,
I KNOW IT'S COLD,
- 好吧，伙计们，
我知道天气很冷，

14:57.413 --> 14:59.620
BUT LET'S JUST PUSH FORWARD
AND KEEP A LOOKOUT
但让我们继续前进
并保持警惕

14:59.724 --> 15:00.896
FOR FROZEN CRAB.
用于冷冻蟹。

15:01.000 --> 15:02.862
- I CAN'T FEEL
MY LOOKING HOLES!
- 我感觉不到
我的洞！

15:02.965 --> 15:05.000
- THE ONLY THING I CAN FEEL
IS MY EMPTY STOMACH.
- 我唯一能感觉到的
我的肚子空空的。

15:05.103 --> 15:06.000
[stomach growls]
[肚子咕咕叫]

15:06.103 --> 15:07.655
- YOU SAID IT, SPONGEBOB.
- 你说过了，海绵宝宝。

15:07.758 --> 15:09.758
I ALREADY GNAWED THROUGH
ALL MY PROVISIONS.
我已经啃完了
我所有的规定。

15:09.862 --> 15:11.206
I'M GETTING TO THE POINT
WHERE I COULD EAT
我进入正题了
我可以在哪里吃饭

15:11.310 --> 15:14.793
JUST ABOUT ANYTHING.
几乎任何事情。

15:14.896 --> 15:16.172
MMM.
嗯。

15:16.275 --> 15:18.275
SPONGE-KEBAB.
海绵烤肉串。

15:18.379 --> 15:19.793
OOH!
哦！

15:19.896 --> 15:23.413
HEY, PATRICK, YOU GOT ANY MORE
OF THEM GOOEY WORMS ON YOU?
嘿，帕特里克，你还有更多吗
你身上有粘糊糊的蠕虫吗？

15:23.517 --> 15:25.000
- I WISH I DID.
- 我希望我做到了。

15:25.103 --> 15:27.000
I LOST MY LAST ONE
TO THAT MONSTER
我失去了最后一个
致那个怪物

15:27.103 --> 15:30.034
AND NOW I'M SO HUNGRY.
现在我好饿。

15:30.137 --> 15:32.103
WELL, AT LEAST I STILL HAVE
THESE JELLYBEANS
好吧，至少我还有
这些软糖

15:32.206 --> 15:36.068
TO HOLD ME OVER.
阻止我。

15:36.172 --> 15:37.482
HEY!
嘿！

15:37.586 --> 15:39.551
IS THIS TAXI EVEN MOVING?
这辆出租车还在行驶吗？

15:39.655 --> 15:40.793
- [shivering]
- [发抖]

15:40.896 --> 15:43.896
- COME ON, GARY!
- 来吧，加里！

15:44.000 --> 15:46.724
- [gasps]
GARY!
- [喘气]
加里！

15:46.827 --> 15:48.241
OH, YOU POOR FELLA.
哦，你这个可怜的家伙。

15:48.344 --> 15:50.172
WE PUSHED YOU TOO HARD,
DIDN'T WE?
我们把你逼得太紧了，
我们不是吗？

15:50.275 --> 15:51.448
SORRY, BUDDY.
对不起，伙计。

15:51.551 --> 15:54.482
I WON'T MAKE YOU
TOW ANOTHER INCH.
我不会让你
再拖一英寸。

15:54.586 --> 15:56.517
- GREAT.
NOW WE'RE STUCK.
- 伟大的。
现在我们陷入困境了。

15:56.620 --> 15:58.103
- NO, WE'RE NOT.
- 不，我们不是。

15:58.206 --> 16:00.068
AH--
啊 -

16:00.172 --> 16:02.413
HELLO.
WHAT'S THIS?
你好。
这是什么？

16:02.517 --> 16:04.379
[gasps]
[喘气]

16:04.482 --> 16:05.689
LOOK!
看！

16:05.793 --> 16:07.448
ONE OF MR. KRABS'
SAILOR TATTOOS.
先生之一。蟹蟹
水手纹身。

16:07.551 --> 16:09.517
IT MUST HAVE FROZEN OFF
OF HIS BRITTLE BODY.
它一定是被冻住了
他脆弱的身体。

16:09.620 --> 16:13.448
- WE MUST BE HEADED
IN THE RIGHT DIRECTION.
- 我们必须带头
方向正确。

16:13.551 --> 16:17.758
- [laughs]
- [笑]

16:17.862 --> 16:19.034
[electronic beeping]
[电子蜂鸣声]

16:19.137 --> 16:23.758
SECRET FORMULA,
YOU ARE MINE!
秘密配方，
你是我的！

16:27.379 --> 16:30.137
PERHAPS I MISJUDGED
THE SCALE ON THAT ONE.
也许我判断错误
那个秤上的秤。

16:30.241 --> 16:32.068
OH!
哦！

16:32.172 --> 16:33.379
THAT DOES IT!
就是这样！

16:33.482 --> 16:34.620
LISTEN UP, SAFE.
听着，安全。

16:34.724 --> 16:36.344
I WILL SPILL YOUR CONTENTS
我会泄露你的内容

16:36.448 --> 16:39.206
EVEN IF I HAVE
TO TEAR YOU APART...
即使我有
把你撕碎...

16:39.310 --> 16:42.034
[grunts]
BIT BY BIT!
[咕哝]
一点一点！

16:42.137 --> 16:43.310
EH!
呃！

16:43.413 --> 16:45.931
MOLECULE BY MOLECULE!
逐个分子！

16:46.034 --> 16:50.482
ATOM BY ATOM!
原子一个原子！

16:50.586 --> 16:52.586
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

16:57.620 --> 16:58.931
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:59.034 --> 17:01.586
OH, CERTAINLY THE SAFE
COULDN'T SURVIVE
哦，当然是保险箱
无法生存

17:01.689 --> 17:03.344
NUCLEAR DETONATION.
核爆炸。

17:03.448 --> 17:05.655
COME TO PAPA!
来爸爸吧！

17:05.758 --> 17:08.862
[laughs]
[笑]

17:08.965 --> 17:13.344
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

17:13.448 --> 17:14.586
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

17:14.689 --> 17:16.206
OH!
HEY!
哦！
嘿！

17:16.310 --> 17:17.689
I'M TRYING TO SLEEP.
我想睡觉。

17:17.793 --> 17:20.241
- MR. KRABS!
- 先生。螃蟹！

17:20.344 --> 17:21.551
- HE AIN'T LOOKING SO GOOD.
- 他看起来不太好。

17:21.655 --> 17:23.689
WE BETTER GET HIM IN THE SLEIGH,
SPONGEBOB.
我们最好把他弄上雪橇
海绵宝宝。

17:23.793 --> 17:25.413
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

17:25.517 --> 17:26.931
HE DONE FROZE UP TOO.
他也僵住了。

17:27.034 --> 17:29.000
[gasps]
[喘气]

17:36.551 --> 17:37.689
- AH!
WHAT?
- 啊！
什么？

17:37.793 --> 17:39.172
YOU'RE BURNING THE SLEIGH?
你正在烧雪橇吗？

17:39.275 --> 17:42.655
ARE YOU AWARE THAT THAT WAS OUR
ONLY MODE OF TRANSPORTATION?
你知道那是我们的吗
唯一的交通方式？

17:42.758 --> 17:45.310
- AND ARE YOU AWARE
THAT I JUST SAVED YOUR LIFE?
- 你知道吗
我刚刚救了你的命？

17:45.413 --> 17:48.517
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

17:48.620 --> 17:50.965
THE RACE!
THE MILLION CLAMS!
比赛！
百万只蛤蜊！

17:51.068 --> 17:53.206
[gasps]
I'VE BEEN TRAPPED IN ICE.
[喘气]
我被困在冰里了。

17:53.310 --> 17:56.413
MUTINOUS THIEVES TRYING
TO CHEAT ME OUT OF ME WINNINGS.
叛乱的盗贼正在尝试
骗取我的奖金。

17:56.517 --> 17:57.620
- OH, COOL DOWN.
- 哦，冷静下来。

17:57.724 --> 17:58.896
THERE ARE NO WINNINGS.
没有奖金。

17:59.000 --> 18:00.275
YOU'VE BEEN DUPED.
- DUPED?
你被骗了。
- 被骗了？

18:00.379 --> 18:01.931
YOU DON'T MEAN BY--
你的意思不是——

18:02.034 --> 18:03.655
- NOW YOU'RE PUTTING
IT TOGETHER.
- 现在你要投入
在一起。

18:03.758 --> 18:05.310
- [gasps]
ME FORMULA!
- [喘气]
我的公式！

18:05.413 --> 18:07.172
WE GOT TO GET BACK
TO BIKINI BOTTOM!
我们得回去
到比基尼底！

18:07.275 --> 18:09.689
- WE MIGHT ACTUALLY HAVE
A CHANCE OF GETTING BACK
- 我们实际上可能有
回来的机会

18:09.793 --> 18:11.206
IF WE HAD A SLEIGH.
如果我们有雪橇。

18:11.310 --> 18:15.482
- WE'RE DOOMED.
[sobbing]
- 我们注定了。
[抽泣]

18:15.586 --> 18:17.827
- NO, WE'RE NOT, MR. KRABS.
- 不，我们不是，先生。螃蟹。

18:17.931 --> 18:19.275
YOUR CHARIOT AWAITS.
您的战车正在等待着您。

18:19.379 --> 18:21.482
- NO OFFENSE, BUT WE'RE
NOT GONNA CATCH PLANKTON
- 无意冒犯，但我们是
不会捕捉浮游生物

18:21.586 --> 18:22.862
MOVING AT A SNAIL'S PACE.
以蜗牛的速度前进。

18:22.965 --> 18:25.275
- JUST LEAVE THAT TO
THE SCIENTIST OF THE GROUP.
- 把它留给
该小组的科学家。

18:25.379 --> 18:26.620
- OH, GEEZ!
- 哦，天哪！

18:26.724 --> 18:29.689
WHY DO I HAVE
TO DO EVERYTHING?
为什么我有
做所有事情？

18:29.793 --> 18:31.965
[laughs]
[笑]

18:32.068 --> 18:33.482
- SHE'S ALL FIRED UP.
- 她很兴奋。

18:33.586 --> 18:36.068
- GARY, MR. KRABS,
ANY HAZARDS ON THE HORIZON?
- 加里先生螃蟹，
未来有什么危险吗？

18:36.172 --> 18:37.724
- LOOKING CLEAR SO FAR!
- 到目前为止看起来很清楚！

18:37.827 --> 18:39.413
- SQUIDWARD,
KEEP THOSE CIRCUITS WARM.
- 章鱼哥，
保持这些电路温暖。

18:39.517 --> 18:42.137
PATRICK, HANG ON!
帕特里克，坚持住！

18:46.655 --> 18:48.620
HOORAY!
WE MADE IT!
万岁！
我们做到了！

18:48.724 --> 18:50.310
- OKAY.
- 好的。

18:50.413 --> 18:51.655
THEN WHERE'S ME RESTAURANT?
那么我的餐厅在哪里？

18:51.758 --> 18:54.655
- PERHAPS OVER THERE.
- 也许在那儿。

18:54.758 --> 18:56.931
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

18:57.034 --> 18:59.034
AND WHERE'S ME FORMULA?
我的公式在哪里？

18:59.137 --> 19:00.724
- PERHAPS OVER THERE.
- 也许在那儿。

19:00.827 --> 19:02.241
- THE CHUM BUCKET...
- 密友桶...

19:02.344 --> 19:04.413
"NOW SERVING KRABBY PATTIES"?
“现在供应蟹肉饼”？

19:04.517 --> 19:05.793
- WE'RE TOO LATE!
- 我们太晚了！

19:05.896 --> 19:09.448
- WE'LL SEE ABOUT THAT,
BOY-O.
- 我们会看到这一点，
男孩-O。

19:09.551 --> 19:10.724
- WHOA, WHOA, WHOA,
WHOA, WHOA!
- 哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇！

19:10.827 --> 19:12.517
YOU CAN'T CUT IN LINE!
你不能插队！

19:12.620 --> 19:13.862
WE'VE BEEN WAITING
FOR A KRABBY PATTY
我们一直在等待
蟹肉饼

19:13.965 --> 19:16.724
FOR THREE STINKIN' DAYS!
臭气熏天的三天！

19:16.827 --> 19:19.413
- THIS WILL ONLY TAKE A MINUTE.
- 这只需要一分钟。

19:19.517 --> 19:21.448
- KEEP YOUR PANTS ON
OUT THERE!
- 穿上你的裤子
就在那里！

19:21.551 --> 19:23.551
I'LL GET YOUR KRABBY PATTIES
JUST AS SOON
我去给你买蟹肉饼
尽快

19:23.655 --> 19:25.689
AS I GET THIS BOTTLE OPEN!
当我打开这瓶酒时！

19:25.793 --> 19:28.482
- NOT IF I HAVE ANYTHING
TO SAY AND/OR DO ABOUT IT.
- 如果我有什么就不要
对它说和/或做。

19:28.586 --> 19:30.137
- KRABS!
- 螃蟹！

19:30.241 --> 19:32.827
WHY AREN'T YOU FROZEN UNDER
THE BARREN TUNDRA?
WHY AREN'T YOU FROZEN UNDER
贫瘠的苔原？

19:32.931 --> 19:34.344
- I GUESS I DIDN'T WANT
TO MISS
- 我想我不想
错过

19:34.448 --> 19:37.103
THE BIG UNVEILING
OF MY SANDWICH!
盛大揭幕
我的三明治！

19:37.206 --> 19:38.379
- WELL, IT WOULD
HAVE HAPPENED
- 嗯，会的
已经发生了

19:38.482 --> 19:40.413
IF I COULD HAVE DISLODGED
THIS STUPID CORK.
如果我可以被驱逐
这个愚蠢的软木塞。

19:40.517 --> 19:43.517
- OH, THAT'S EASY.
- 哦，那很简单。

19:43.620 --> 19:45.172
all: PATRICK!
所有人：帕特里克！

19:45.275 --> 19:48.620
- [chuckles]
I GOT IT NOW, KRABSY!
- [轻笑]
我现在明白了，Krabsy！

19:48.724 --> 19:50.620
- THAT MAY BE TRUE,
PLANKTON,
- 这可能是真的，
浮游生物，

19:50.724 --> 19:52.344
BUT YOU GOT SEVEN
ANGRY CUSTOMERS
但你有七个
愤怒的顾客

19:52.448 --> 19:54.413
FLANKING YOU ON ALL SIDES.
从四面八方包围你。

19:54.517 --> 19:58.034
- UH, WELL,
I'M SURE MY LOVING WIFE
- 呃，好吧，
我确信我深爱的妻子

19:58.137 --> 20:00.413
IS NOT A PARTY
TO THIS ANGRY MOB.
不是派对
对于这个愤怒的暴民。

20:00.517 --> 20:02.586
YOU GOT TO HELP ME HERE,
KAREN.
你必须在这里帮助我，
凯伦。

20:02.689 --> 20:04.275
- "YOU GOT TO HELP ME."
- “你必须帮助我。”

20:04.379 --> 20:06.793
MY MONITOR NEARLY FROZE UP
FOR GOOD
我的显示器几乎死机
永远

20:06.896 --> 20:08.931
ON YOUR LITTLE RACE
TO OBLIVION.
在你的小比赛中
遗忘。

20:09.034 --> 20:11.758
- BABES, DON'T BLOW
AN OP AMP OVER THIS.
- 宝贝们，别吹
一个运算放大器在此之上。

20:11.862 --> 20:13.241
COME ON.
快点。

20:13.344 --> 20:14.827
YOWZAH!
哟扎！

20:14.931 --> 20:17.931
OW, THAT HURT
ON SO MANY LEVELS.
哇，好痛
在很多层面上。

20:18.034 --> 20:19.517
OKAY, I GIVE UP.
好吧，我放弃了。

20:19.620 --> 20:21.206
YOU WIN AGAIN, KRABS.
你又赢了，蟹蟹。

20:21.310 --> 20:22.379
- AND HAND OVER ME FORMULA.
- 把配方交给我。

20:22.482 --> 20:24.068
- OKAY, EUGENE.
- 好吧，尤金。

20:24.172 --> 20:27.448
I'LL JUST SIGN
THE SURRENDER TREATY FIRST.
我就签名
首先是投降条约。

20:27.551 --> 20:29.758
OOH, HERE I GO.
哦，我开始了。

20:29.862 --> 20:31.137
[laughs]
[笑]

20:31.241 --> 20:33.931
OUTSMARTED YOU AGAIN,
EH, FOOLS?
再次智胜你，
呃，傻瓜？

20:34.034 --> 20:35.034
[laughs]
[笑]

20:35.137 --> 20:36.862
- YOU GET BACK HERE,
PLANKTON!
- 你回到这里，
浮游生物！

20:36.965 --> 20:40.517
- HERE WE GO AGAIN.
- 又来了。

20:40.620 --> 20:43.275
GIVE UP NOW AND
I'LL LET YOU KEEP
现在放弃并且
我会让你保留

20:43.379 --> 20:44.655
ONE OF YOUR ANTENNAE!
你的一根天线！

20:44.758 --> 20:47.413
- I'D BE DELIGHTED
TO SEE YOU TRY!
- 我很高兴
看你尝试！

20:47.517 --> 20:52.724
OOH!
YOU'RE SO CLOSE.
哦！
你已经很接近了。

20:52.827 --> 20:56.310
SO LONG, SUCKERS!
再见，傻瓜们！

20:56.413 --> 20:57.965
- HUH?
[all gasp]
- 嗯？
[全都喘气]

20:58.068 --> 21:00.068
- [laughs]
- [笑]

21:00.172 --> 21:01.793
- WE'RE TRAPPED.
- 我们被困住了。

21:01.896 --> 21:03.448
- THAT'S RIGHT, KRABS.
- 没错，蟹蟹。

21:03.551 --> 21:04.965
AND IF YOU'RE THINKING
OF BUSTING OUT,
如果你在想
退出，

21:05.068 --> 21:08.172
MIND THE GIANT VAT
OF FRY GREASE BENEATH YOU.
注意巨大的缸
你身下的油炸油脂。

21:08.275 --> 21:10.793
- HE'S GONNA TURN US
INTO FRIED SNACKS.
- 他会改变我们
变成油炸小吃。

21:10.896 --> 21:12.448
- GOT ANY DIPPING SAUCE?
- 有蘸酱吗？

21:12.551 --> 21:14.310
- A LITTLE TASTE
OF YOUR OWN MEDICINE,
- 一点味道
您自己的药物，

21:14.413 --> 21:15.965
EH, KRABCAKES?
呃，蟹饼？

21:16.068 --> 21:19.034
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

21:22.034 --> 21:24.068
NUM-NUM!
NUM-NUM！
NUM-NUM！
数数！

21:24.172 --> 21:25.172
- NUM-NUM?
- 数字-数字？

21:25.275 --> 21:30.482
- NUM-NUM!
- 数字数字！

21:30.586 --> 21:34.896
[screaming]
[尖叫]

21:35.000 --> 21:36.689
NUM-NUM!
NUM-NUM！
NUM-NUM！
数数！

21:36.793 --> 21:38.862
- NO, WAIT,
BIG SCARY MONSTER!
- 不，等等，
可怕的大怪物！

21:38.965 --> 21:40.379
DON'T EAT PATRICK.
EAT ME.
不要吃帕特里克。
吃我。

21:40.482 --> 21:42.034
I'M PACKED WITH NUTRIENTS.
我充满了营养。

21:42.137 --> 21:43.344
- NO!
EAT ME!
- 不！
吃我！

21:43.448 --> 21:44.655
- DON'T EAT ME!
- 别吃我！

21:44.758 --> 21:46.206
EAT SQUIDWARD!
吃章鱼哥！

21:46.310 --> 21:48.965
- WAIT.
WHAT?
- 等待。
什么？

21:49.068 --> 21:51.103
- [shudders]
- [颤抖]

21:57.793 --> 21:59.689
- NUM-NUM!
- 数字数字！

21:59.793 --> 22:02.034
MMM.
嗯。

22:02.137 --> 22:04.379
- SHE LOVES YOUR JELLYBEANS,
PATRICK.
- 她喜欢你的软糖，
帕特里克。

22:04.482 --> 22:06.896
- I'D BETTER GO WHILE
THE GOING'S GOOD.
- 我最好走一会儿
进展顺利。

22:07.000 --> 22:10.068
- JELLYBEAN!
- 软糖！

22:10.172 --> 22:14.068
- I CAN PRACTICALLY TASTE
THOSE KRABBY PATTIES NOW.
- 我几乎可以品尝
现在是那些蟹肉饼。

22:14.172 --> 22:15.241
[grunts]
[咕哝]

22:15.344 --> 22:17.793
[screams]
[尖叫声]

22:20.034 --> 22:22.793
- HEY, MR. KRABS,
WHAT HAPPENS TO PLANKTON?
- 嘿，先生。螃蟹，
浮游生物会发生什么？

22:22.896 --> 22:24.034
- HE'LL JUST HAVE
TO WAIT FOR NATURE
- 他就会有
等待自然

22:24.137 --> 22:25.724
TO TAKE ITS COURSE.
顺其自然。

22:25.827 --> 22:26.862
[laughs]
[笑]

22:26.965 --> 22:29.827
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

22:29.931 --> 22:33.827
- WELL, I SUPPOSE DEAR OLD DAD
WAS RIGHT.
- 嗯，我想亲爱的老爸爸
是对的。

22:33.931 --> 22:38.517
I SHOULD HAVE MINORED
IN BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION.
我应该辅修
在工商管理领域。

22:38.620 --> 22:40.862
[toilet flushing]
[冲厕所]

22:43.275 --> 22:46.241
